# Gene names
capibara-gene-perennial-name = Perennial
capibara-gene-perennial-desc = The plant lives much longer and produces continuously, but grows slightly slower.

capibara-gene-fibrous-name = Fibrous
capibara-gene-fibrous-desc = Strong plant fibers increase endurance. Produce can be processed into cloth.

capibara-gene-juicy-name = Juicy
capibara-gene-juicy-desc = Enhanced liquid content increases chemical yield when processed.

capibara-gene-hardy-name = Hardy
capibara-gene-hardy-desc = A tough, resilient plant that survives harsh conditions but produces less potent chemicals.

capibara-gene-thorny-name = Thorny
capibara-gene-thorny-desc = Sharp thorns deter pests and weeds. Handle with gloves!

capibara-gene-aromatic-name = Aromatic
capibara-gene-aromatic-desc = Pleasant fragrance improves mood of nearby crew. Slightly increases potency.

capibara-gene-dense-name = Dense
capibara-gene-dense-desc = Heavier, denser produce. More potent but yields fewer units.
capibara-gene-stimulant-name = Stimulant
capibara-gene-stimulant-desc = Produce contains ephedrine, giving a small speed boost when consumed.
capibara-gene-vitalizing-name = Vitalizing
capibara-gene-vitalizing-desc = Produce contains bicaridine, healing brute damage when consumed.
capibara-gene-hemostatic-name = Hemostatic
capibara-gene-hemostatic-desc = Produce contains tranexamic acid, stopping bleeding when consumed.
capibara-gene-overmutated-name = Overmutated
capibara-gene-overmutated-desc = The plant's genome is dangerously unstable. Loses 10 health each growth cycle, slowly killing it.

capibara-gene-bioluminescent-name = Bioluminescent
capibara-gene-bioluminescent-desc = The plant and its produce emit a soft glow. Can be used as a light source.

capibara-gene-slippery-name = Slippery
capibara-gene-slippery-desc = Produce creates a slip hazard on impact. Any fruit becomes a banana peel.

