# Phase 3 genes - Stat-boost (replaces old stat mutations)
capibara-gene-high-yield-name = High Yield
capibara-gene-high-yield-desc = Enhanced fruiting body produces more units per harvest.

capibara-gene-potent-bloom-name = Potent Bloom
capibara-gene-potent-bloom-desc = Concentrated chemical production increases potency of all compounds.

capibara-gene-long-lived-name = Long-Lived
capibara-gene-long-lived-desc = Extended cellular lifespan keeps the plant alive much longer.

capibara-gene-quick-grower-name = Quick Grower
capibara-gene-quick-grower-desc = Accelerated cell division reduces time to maturity.

capibara-gene-productive-name = Productive
capibara-gene-productive-desc = Faster fruit development reduces time between harvests.

capibara-gene-water-efficient-name = Water Efficient
capibara-gene-water-efficient-desc = Optimized root system reduces water consumption.

capibara-gene-nutrient-efficient-name = Nutrient Efficient
capibara-gene-nutrient-efficient-desc = Efficient nutrient uptake reduces fertilizer needs.

capibara-gene-heat-resistant-name = Heat Resistant
capibara-gene-heat-resistant-desc = Thermostable proteins allow the plant to tolerate higher temperatures.

capibara-gene-pest-resistant-name = Pest Resistant
capibara-gene-pest-resistant-desc = Natural pest deterrents protect the plant from insect damage.

capibara-gene-weed-resistant-name = Weed Resistant
capibara-gene-weed-resistant-desc = Aggressive root system outcompetes weeds for resources.

# Phase 4 genes - Boolean traits (replaces old toggle mutations)
capibara-gene-seedless-name = Seedless
capibara-gene-seedless-desc = Produces seedless fruit. No seeds can be harvested from this plant.

capibara-gene-ligneous-name = Ligneous
capibara-gene-ligneous-desc = Woody stem makes the plant resistant to being uprooted. Increased endurance.

capibara-gene-vocal-cords-name = Vocal Cords
capibara-gene-vocal-cords-desc = The plant develops primitive vocal organs. It screams when harvested.

capibara-gene-kudzu-name = Kudzu
capibara-gene-kudzu-desc = Invasive vine growth outcompetes weeds but slowly drains the plant's health each cycle.

capibara-gene-perennial-harvest-name = Perennial Harvest
capibara-gene-perennial-harvest-desc = The plant regrows fruit after harvesting instead of dying.

capibara-gene-self-harvest-name = Self-Harvest
capibara-gene-self-harvest-desc = Mature fruit drops automatically without manual harvesting.

# Phase 2 genes - Uncommon
capibara-gene-sticky-name = Sticky
capibara-gene-sticky-desc = Produce sticks to targets on throw, continuously applying chemicals over time.

capibara-gene-healing-name = Healing
capibara-gene-healing-desc = Produce heals on contact. Topical application, not just eating.

capibara-gene-gaseous-name = Gaseous
capibara-gene-gaseous-desc = Produce releases a gas cloud when broken. Gas type depends on plant's exuded gases.

capibara-gene-fermentable-name = Fermentable
capibara-gene-fermentable-desc = Produce auto-ferments over time. Chemicals transform into alcohol variants.

capibara-gene-adaptive-name = Adaptive
capibara-gene-adaptive-desc = Increased environmental tolerance. Epigenetic modifiers last twice as long.

capibara-gene-crystalline-name = Crystalline
capibara-gene-crystalline-desc = Produce becomes crystal-like. Shatters into sharp fragments on impact but is more potent.

# Phase 2 genes - Rare
capibara-gene-explosive-name = Explosive
capibara-gene-explosive-desc = Produce detonates on hard impact. Explodes in the grinder. Handle with extreme care.

capibara-gene-bluespace-name = Bluespace
capibara-gene-bluespace-desc = Produce teleports the user when eaten and teleports on throw. Unstable spatial effects.

capibara-gene-electrical-name = Electrical
capibara-gene-electrical-desc = Produce shocks on contact. Can be used as a single-use taser. Increases water consumption.

capibara-gene-metallic-name = Metallic
capibara-gene-metallic-desc = Produce becomes hard as metal. High melee and throw damage. Very durable but lower yield.

capibara-gene-toxic-name = Toxic
capibara-gene-toxic-desc = Produce releases a poison cloud when broken. Acid damage on contact. Increased toxin tolerance.

capibara-gene-sentient-name = Sentient
capibara-gene-sentient-desc = Produce is alive. It screams, wiggles, and tries to escape your hands.

capibara-gene-mimetic-name = Mimetic
capibara-gene-mimetic-desc = Mime-infused produce. Silences anyone who eats it or is hit by it for 2 minutes.

capibara-gene-honking-name = Honking
capibara-gene-honking-desc = Produce honks on impact. Stun effect on targets. Bonus damage to mimes.


